  "customNotes": [
    {
      "timestamp": 1779212122071,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "architecture",
      "content": "TeamForge revised to use Anthropic Messages API for all agent execution. Each subagent runs an autonomous \"goal mode\" agentic loop: receives a task, calls Anthropic API with tools, executes tool results, loops until done. Architecture: lib/anthropic/ (agent-runner.ts for goal mode, coordinator.ts for planning/delegation, tools.ts with remember/recall from Memawi, scout.ts for feature discovery, reviewer.ts for quality gate, loop.ts for always-on orchestrator). Memawi integration via lib/memawi.ts HTTP client. API routes: /api/run (SSE mission execution), /api/tasks (CRUD task board), /api/orchestrator (cycle/continuous/scout), /api/memory (Memawi proxy), /api/test-connection. Old lib/mastra/ removed."
    }
  ],
